[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: JSON blob + defaults (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mOne localStorage key, a defaults table, corrupt data falls back safely.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: One key per preference
     [38;5;246mSimplest possible; no parsing, but no cheap reset or versioning.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: A plus subscriptions
     [38;5;246mAdds a subscribe/notify layer for reactive UI updates.[39m
